00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:36.980
Black Summoner

00:12:49.080 --> 00:12:51.110
You're late.

00:12:51.110 --> 00:12:52.200
You saw 'em, huh?

00:12:52.200 --> 00:12:56.900
Yes. Some people have surrounded the
mansion and are acting suspiciously.

00:12:57.440 --> 00:13:01.540
I'd say there's about... 14 of them?

00:13:01.780 --> 00:13:05.300
Sister Sera told me about them.

00:13:05.300 --> 00:13:07.550
I didn't notice them at all.

00:13:10.890 --> 00:13:13.320
I put Efil and Melfina to bed.

00:13:13.620 --> 00:13:17.290
Gerard is guarding Elly and Luca's room.

00:13:17.760 --> 00:13:19.560
Then, they'll be safe.

00:13:24.070 --> 00:13:26.570
Level 19

00:13:24.070 --> 00:13:26.570
Level 18

00:13:24.070 --> 00:13:26.570
Level 17

00:13:24.420 --> 00:13:28.770
They don't look that strong
from what I can tell...

00:13:26.320 --> 00:13:29.070
Level 16

00:13:26.320 --> 00:13:29.070
Level 15

00:13:28.530 --> 00:13:31.200
Level 20

00:13:28.530 --> 00:13:31.200
Level 15

00:13:28.770 --> 00:13:30.800
The highest is level 20.

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:37.290
Level 26

00:13:31.320 --> 00:13:34.190
No, one's level 26.

00:13:34.190 --> 00:13:37.300
He's apart from the others.
Maybe he's the boss?

00:13:37.630 --> 00:13:39.120
You can see them from here?

00:13:39.350 --> 00:13:43.080
Yeah, I borrowed Far Seeing from Efil.

00:13:43.080 --> 00:13:44.370
What do we do?

00:13:44.370 --> 00:13:46.040
Should I take care of them?

00:13:47.130 --> 00:13:48.760
Hmm...

00:13:50.260 --> 00:13:52.980
Rion, can you and Alex handle it?

00:13:53.780 --> 00:13:54.880
Me?

00:13:55.180 --> 00:13:58.390
They're a perfect test
of what you've learned.

00:13:59.000 --> 00:14:02.830
Silent Whisper is active
inside the mansion's gates.

00:14:03.350 --> 00:14:05.830
I'll send the golems at the gate inside.

00:14:05.830 --> 00:14:08.120
So start with the ones
who cross inside first.

00:14:08.710 --> 00:14:09.720
Can you do it?

00:14:13.890 --> 00:14:16.490
Yeah! I'll try it!

00:14:16.490 --> 00:14:19.490
Okay, that's my little sister.

00:14:19.490 --> 00:14:21.730
Clotho, make a mini-you for them.

00:14:25.750 --> 00:14:27.750
Thanks, Clotho.

00:14:28.380 --> 00:14:31.200
I'll upload the information
I learn from Detect Presence

00:14:31.200 --> 00:14:34.830
and Far Seeing to the
servant network. Use it.

00:14:37.490 --> 00:14:39.700
This is really helpful!

00:14:40.020 --> 00:14:41.580
Thanks, Brother Kel!

00:14:42.190 --> 00:14:44.060
And use this.

00:14:45.350 --> 00:14:46.610
What is it?

00:14:47.090 --> 00:14:50.160
It's called the Resonating Mithril Sword.

00:14:50.590 --> 00:14:56.130
I used my Blacksmithing skill to reforge it
from a sword I got from a guy named Cashel.

00:14:56.610 --> 00:14:59.090
It'll do for your first weapon.

00:15:00.470 --> 00:15:02.590
Thanks, Brother Kel!

00:15:02.590 --> 00:15:04.020
Now go!

00:15:04.020 --> 00:15:06.040
It's the first battle for our family's hero!

00:15:06.450 --> 00:15:07.430
Okay!

00:15:08.620 --> 00:15:13.760
I'm told the master of that mansion
was working with the Deramis heroes

00:15:13.760 --> 00:15:18.010
when Lord Christoph was captured.

00:15:18.010 --> 00:15:24.270
He'll have to die, before he can get in
the way of the Militant Nation of Trycen!

00:15:27.720 --> 00:15:30.500
This place really is like a dream.

00:15:31.460 --> 00:15:35.110
Sister Efil is so kind
and such a good cook...

00:15:35.110 --> 00:15:38.200
Brother Kel... It feels like I've
known him for a long time somehow.

00:15:38.780 --> 00:15:42.640
And Sister Sera and the others
are so much fun to be around.

00:15:43.570 --> 00:15:46.460
I want to help them all, too!

00:15:46.790 --> 00:15:48.570
Let's go, Alex!

00:15:50.470 --> 00:15:52.890
Let's see what she can do.

00:15:53.340 --> 00:15:54.220
Yup.

00:16:01.930 --> 00:16:04.580
She needs to work on the
way she uses that sword,

00:16:04.580 --> 00:16:07.930
but she's got enough of a knack
to learn Rank S Swordsmanship.

00:16:07.930 --> 00:16:11.620
If Gerard trains her properly,
she'll be unstoppable.

00:16:12.090 --> 00:16:15.910
And she's doing a great job
working smoothly with Alex.

00:16:16.520 --> 00:16:20.320
At this rate, not one of them's
going to make it to the mansion.

00:16:21.470 --> 00:16:23.130
So I don't get to do anything, huh?

00:16:29.080 --> 00:16:30.560
That's all of them.

00:16:33.120 --> 00:16:36.420
Our first mission's complete, huh, Alex?

00:16:38.850 --> 00:16:40.610
Yay!

00:16:42.840 --> 00:16:45.260
Clotho, you're on cleanup.

00:16:46.040 --> 00:16:50.890
I'll do a bare minimum of healing on them
before turning them over to the guild.

00:16:52.750 --> 00:16:56.210
Okay, I'll go deal with
the ones who are hiding.

00:16:56.210 --> 00:16:58.770
Sera, you go talk to Rion and Alex.

00:16:58.770 --> 00:17:00.110
Roger.

00:17:02.250 --> 00:17:05.280
They're late... Did they fail?

00:17:06.360 --> 00:17:09.280
We've got no choice but to retreat, then.

00:17:10.960 --> 00:17:12.610
They're not coming.

00:17:13.380 --> 00:17:17.270
My sister took them all down.

00:17:18.960 --> 00:17:20.530
So that's it...

00:17:20.530 --> 00:17:25.480
It wasn't the Deramis heroes that
defeated Lord Christoph...

00:17:30.770 --> 00:17:35.780
