00:17:30.770 --> 00:17:35.780
Black Summoner

00:17:41.650 --> 00:17:45.740
In the name of Zel Trycen, Emperor
of the Militant Nation of Trycen,

00:17:45.740 --> 00:17:48.080
I begin this meeting of the Round Table.

00:17:48.970 --> 00:17:51.620
I brought you here to
discuss a serious matter.

00:17:49.540 --> 00:17:52.050
Emperor
Zel Trycen

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:54.820
Is this about Christoph, Dad?

00:17:53.050 --> 00:18:00.890
Dragoon General
Azgrad Trycen

00:17:55.280 --> 00:18:00.890
Securing slaves in Toraj
was Tristan's idea, right?

00:18:00.890 --> 00:18:05.750
I had such high hopes for them, too.

00:18:01.890 --> 00:18:11.360
Mixed Demon Beast Army General
Tristan Faze

00:18:05.750 --> 00:18:08.550
But they were just barbaric
adventurers, I suppose.

00:18:08.550 --> 00:18:11.350
Not useful for anything.

00:18:11.350 --> 00:18:14.720
Tristan, your excuses are meaningless.

00:18:12.320 --> 00:18:19.570
Ironsteel Knights General
Dan Dalba

00:18:12.690 --> 00:18:19.570
Dark General
Shutora Trycen

00:18:15.190 --> 00:18:19.580
This incident has brought some of
our nation's shadows to light.

00:18:19.580 --> 00:18:25.370
Gaun, Toraj, and Deramis are
already forming an alliance.

00:18:25.370 --> 00:18:28.780
How will you take responsibility
for this failure?

00:18:28.780 --> 00:18:33.210
Don't get so upset, General Dan.

00:18:33.570 --> 00:18:35.890
You'll take years off your life.

00:18:35.890 --> 00:18:37.240
What?

00:18:37.240 --> 00:18:40.160
Stop it. You're in the Emperor's presence.

00:18:40.160 --> 00:18:42.050
Princess Shutora...

00:18:43.290 --> 00:18:46.960
You really do adore the princess,
don't you, Old General?

00:18:47.930 --> 00:18:52.210
Tristan, Dan is mostly correct.

00:18:52.210 --> 00:18:55.400
Our nation is now in dire peril.

00:18:55.580 --> 00:18:59.610
I've been telling them that Christoph
has nothing to do with Trycen,

00:18:59.610 --> 00:19:01.530
but that's not enough.

00:19:02.050 --> 00:19:06.360
If we're not careful, we could find
ourselves in a war with all three nations.

00:19:06.580 --> 00:19:09.080
Let's do it, then.

00:19:10.070 --> 00:19:11.780
Let's have a war.

00:19:12.270 --> 00:19:14.290
Are you insane, Tristan?

00:19:14.790 --> 00:19:17.240
Think about it!

00:19:17.240 --> 00:19:25.560
While we were militarizing, the other
three countries were enjoying the peace.

00:19:25.960 --> 00:19:30.810
Their weak armies are no match for us.

00:19:30.810 --> 00:19:36.440
Now is the time to achieve our long-held
dream and unify the continent.

00:19:36.790 --> 00:19:42.190
True, unifying the continent
is one of our great goals.

00:19:42.190 --> 00:19:43.330
Princess?

00:19:44.600 --> 00:19:47.700
So you agree, Princess Shutora?

00:19:47.700 --> 00:19:50.540
But now's not the time.

00:19:50.540 --> 00:19:54.770
They aren't as weak as your
words suggest, General.

00:19:54.770 --> 00:19:57.170
I'm in favor of the war.

00:19:57.170 --> 00:19:58.960
Brother Azgrad!

00:19:59.180 --> 00:20:02.800
I've had several skirmishes
with Gaun's forces,

00:20:02.800 --> 00:20:05.490
and they didn't seem that strong to me.

00:20:06.330 --> 00:20:10.140
And we Dragoons have something
special up our sleeve.

00:20:17.960 --> 00:20:21.690
You want to try out the new power you have?

00:20:25.510 --> 00:20:29.280
Now it's two in favor, one opposed.

00:20:30.330 --> 00:20:32.680
I'm opposed, of course!

00:20:32.680 --> 00:20:35.040
The very idea is ridiculous!

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:37.470
Then the votes are tied.

00:20:37.470 --> 00:20:40.460
And General Clive is all that's left, but...

00:20:45.920 --> 00:20:47.920
Very well, Tristan.

00:20:48.490 --> 00:20:53.330
I will leave the fate of our nation
to the votes of you five generals.

00:20:54.330 --> 00:20:55.730
Call Clive!

00:21:00.250 --> 00:21:04.130
What am I doing here?

00:21:08.390 --> 00:21:13.780
Tch. The Magic Knights HQ
is such a creepy place.

00:21:21.370 --> 00:21:25.330
It's not locked. Come in.

00:21:25.760 --> 00:21:26.930
Excuse me.

00:21:29.770 --> 00:21:35.270
Oh, you're not one of my
soldiers. Who are you?

00:21:35.750 --> 00:21:38.810
Jin Dalba, with the Ironsteel Knights!

00:21:38.810 --> 00:21:42.160
Oh, Dan's son?

00:21:42.160 --> 00:21:45.760
His Highness requires your
attendance at the Round Table.

00:21:46.150 --> 00:21:49.030
Please come immediately, General Clive.

00:21:50.070 --> 00:21:52.580
What a pain!

00:21:53.610 --> 00:21:55.530
Sure, I guess.

00:21:55.760 --> 00:21:58.560
I just have one question.

00:22:05.970 --> 00:22:08.920
Am I pretty?

00:22:06.010 --> 00:22:09.970
Magic Knights General
Clive Therese
